---
const reasons = [
  {
    title: 'The homepage sounds like everyone else',
    desc: 'When the message is broad, visitors do not immediately understand why this business is the better choice. That weakens trust before the sales process even begins.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Service pages explain but do not persuade',
    desc: 'Many pages list services without handling real objections, clarifying outcomes, or guiding people toward the next step.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Trust appears too late',
    desc: 'Buyers often need reassurance before they are willing to call. If proof, credibility, process, or fit guidance are missing, hesitation rises fast.',
  },
  {
    title: 'SEO and conversion are treated as separate jobs',
    desc: 'A page can rank and still fail. If the landing experience is weak, the business pays for traffic without getting the full benefit.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section-padding bg-stone-50">
  <div class="content-width">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">
      <div>
        <h2 class="heading-lg mb-6">Why Most Local Business Websites Still Leak Leads</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg mb-8">
          The problem is usually not one dramatic mistake. It is a stack of smaller issues that make the business feel weaker than it actually is. A generic hero, short service pages, weak proof, buried CTAs, and no clear sense of who the offer is really for. Together, those issues create friction at exactly the moment a buyer is deciding whether to trust you.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-6">
          {reasons.map((r) => (
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1e3a5f]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#1e3a5f]" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-1">{r.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-stone-600">{r.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <img
          src="/images/why-most-fail.webp"
          alt="Website audit view showing trust, CTA, and page-structure gaps"
          class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-md object-cover aspect-[4/3] max-h-[320px]"
          width="640"
          height="480"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />

        <div class="card-elevated p-8">
          <h3 class="heading-sm mb-4">What a stronger site does differently</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-stone-600">
            <li>• Clarifies the offer faster</li>
            <li>• Builds trust before asking for contact</li>
            <li>• Makes service pages easier to compare and act on</li>
            <li>• Aligns local search visibility with landing-page quality</li>
          </ul>

          <a href="/contact#audit" class="btn-primary mt-6 w-full">Get a Free Website & SEO Audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
